---
import LegalPage from '../../components/pages/LegalPage.astro'
import { site } from '../../data/site'
import { pathFor } from '../../i18n'
---

<LegalPage
  lang="en"
  page="privacy"
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How GlowHaus Aesthetics handles the information you send us through this website: contact form, WhatsApp and map."
>
  <!--
  General template written for the website. The clinic should review it with its
  legal advisor before treating it as final.
  -->
  <p>
    At {site.name} ("GlowHaus," "we," "us") we respect your privacy. This policy explains what
    information we collect through this website, how we use it, and the choices you have. It applies
    to the website only; the clinical information you share during your appointment is governed by
    our Notice of Privacy Practices (HIPAA), which we provide at the clinic.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    {site.name}, {site.address.street}, {site.address.city}, {site.address.region}{' '}
    {site.address.zip}, United States. Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    Phone: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you use the contact form, you send us:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your name;</li>
    <li>your phone number and/or email address;</li>
    <li>
      the reason you are contacting us and, if you choose one, the treatment you are interested in;
    </li>
    <li>the message you write.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not ask for or need any other information to reply. Like any website, our hosting provider
    may log basic technical data (IP address, browser, date and time) for security purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>Please don't send medical information through the form</h2>
  <p>
    The form and email are not appropriate channels for health information. Please do not include
    diagnoses, medications, photos or other medical details. We will go over all of that in person
    during your assessment. This website does not store medical records.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your message and to schedule or confirm your appointment.</li>
    <li>To give you the information you ask for about treatments, pricing and payment options.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not sell or rent your information, and we do not use it for third-party advertising. We
    will only send you promotions if you specifically ask us to.
  </p>

  <h2>How the form is sent</h2>
  <p>
    The form is delivered by email through EmailJS, a service that sends the message to the clinic's
    inbox. EmailJS processes the data only to deliver it, under its own privacy policy. We keep
    messages in our email for as long as we need to assist you and keep our records.
  </p>

  <h2>WhatsApp, phone and social media</h2>
  <p>
    WhatsApp buttons open a conversation in the WhatsApp app (Meta). From that point on, WhatsApp's
    terms and privacy policy apply. The same goes for links to Instagram and other social networks.
  </p>

  <h2>Google Maps</h2>
  <p>
    The contact section shows a Google Maps embed, which loads as you scroll near it. When it loads,
    Google may receive your IP address and use cookies under its own privacy policy.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This website currently does not use analytics or advertising cookies. If we add them in the
    future, we will update this policy and, where required, ask for your consent.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served over an encrypted connection (HTTPS), and access to messages is limited to
    clinic staff who need it. No system is completely secure, but we take reasonable steps to
    protect your information.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us at any time what information we have about you, to correct it or delete it, or to
    stop contacting you. Email us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will
    get back to you as soon as possible. As a patient, you also have the rights HIPAA grants you
    over your health information, described in our Notice of Privacy Practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    This website is intended for people 18 and older. We do not knowingly collect information from
    minors through the form.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy. The date above shows the latest version. Please also see our{' '}
    <a href={pathFor('en', 'terms')}>terms of use</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
